y apllied, so it might be something to do with the ui of the material editing menu or something, tho yeah, idk if its my device or not though, if it isn't then see if you can replicate the bug, its pretty easy for me to replicate, I can probably get a video if needed, tho yeah\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a MeshInstance3D node in the 3D editor and add collision (idk if collision has anything to do with it but my meshes had it) then go to Surface Material Override and create a new basic material, then click or tap on the material to try and open the material editor, then the crash happens\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116911/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116911/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}